# Git LFS — keep large binary assets out of the main git history.
# Set up via `git lfs install` (done 2026-08-05).
# Storage budget: 12 MB public/assets + 340 KB PDFs as of 2026-08-05.
# LFS gives us 1 GB free on GitHub, so we're well under for a long time.

# Portfolio assets — images for Hero carousel, project covers, certifications, RTIC photo.
public/assets/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# CV PDFs served as static downloads from the public root.
public/*.pdf filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text